# Unstoppable Plan: "At the beginning of your end step, untap all nonland permanents you control." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with
# Island, Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet, all tapped for it; at Bot1's end step the Plan untaps the two Moxen (nonland artifacts) and
# not the Island (a land, CR 701.26b). Bot2 tapped its Mox Ruby on its own turn: the Plan untaps only what Bot1 controls, so
# that stays tapped through Bot1's end step. It does not trigger at Bot2's end step: a Mox Bot1 taps on Bot2's turn stays tapped
# through it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Unstoppable Plan
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Unstoppable Plan.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = true
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
[T2 Bot2.End]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = true
[T3 Bot1.End]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = true
